1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,540
(Sheldon:)Point of inquiry,

2
00:00:02,540 --> 00:00:05,170
(Sheldon:)given that Leonard is
your secondary friend

3
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:07,580
(Sheldon:)and Koothrappali is
your primary friend,

4
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:09,840
(Sheldon:)why didn't you seek refuge
under his roof?

5
00:00:09,850 --> 00:00:11,080
(Howard:)There's no room.

6
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:12,480
(Howard:)His sister is staying with him.

7
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:14,650
(Leonard:)Wait, wait. What?

8
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:15,900
(Sheldon:)Cocoa, Leonard.
Focus.

9
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:18,620
(Sheldon:)I'm down in
the dumps here.

10
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:21,440
(Leonard:)Priya's in town?

11
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:23,140
(Howard:)Yeah, some work thing.

12
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:26,230
(Howard:)Anyway, my mother seems
to think that Bernadette...

13
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:28,330
(Leonard:)Hold on.
When did Priya get here?

14
00:00:28,330 --> 00:00:30,370
(Howard:)I don't know.
A couple of days ago.

15
00:00:30,370 --> 00:00:33,320
(Howard:)The thing is, Bernadette doesn't
like that I have to take care

16
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:36,000
(Howard:)of my mother, and my mother
doesn't trust Bernadette...

17
00:00:36,010 --> 00:00:37,160
(Leonard:)Yeah, that's a real pickle.

18
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:38,370
(Leonard:)Bye.

19
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:43,410
(Sheldon:)Don't worry.

20
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:45,300
(Sheldon:)As your tertiary friend,

21
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:48,350
(Sheldon:)I am prepared to step in
and comfort you.

22
00:00:48,350 --> 00:00:50,600
(Howard:)That's not really necessary.

23
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,170
(Sheldon:)No, no. I'll finish
making the tea,

24
00:00:52,170 --> 00:00:54,170
(Sheldon:)while you narcissistically
ramble on

25
00:00:54,170 --> 00:00:56,220
(Sheldon:)about whatever's troubling you.

26
00:00:56,230 --> 00:00:58,130
(Howard:)Thanks.

